<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:lang="lzh"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>革員病瘋</title><title type="alternate">Ge yuan bing feng [A Dismissed Official Assessed as Mentally Unwell]</title><author>圖說未見署名，畫款另記</author><respStmt><resp>整理與編碼</resp><name>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu)</name></respStmt></titleStmt><editionStmt><edition>Transcription dataset v0.1.0</edition></editionStmt><publicationStmt><p>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu). Dataset edition 0.1.0.</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>點石齋畫報</title><date when="1884">1884，甲六第47圖</date><idno>L.sin. K 175-1/10 / bsb00075644, scan 54, 甲六第47圖</idno><ref target="https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/en/view/bsb00075644?page=54">巴伐利亞邦立圖書館</ref></bibl></sourceDesc></fileDesc></teiHeader><facsimile><surface n="54" xml:id="original-page"><graphic url="https://api.digitale-sammlungen.de/iiif/image/v3/bsb00075644_00054/full/2600,/0/default.jpg" /></surface></facsimile><text><body><div type="article"><pb n="54" facs="#original-page" /><head>革員病瘋</head><p><lb n="left-1" />前者浙藩司德方伯詣<lb n="left-2" />文廟拈香有已革候補知縣陳某徘徊門左錢塘<lb n="left-3" />縣程邑尊見其形跡可疑命役盤詰搜出<lb n="left-4" />洋鎗一桿小刀一柄程邑尊帶至杭府請<lb n="left-5" />示方伯亦於是刻聞信面稟撫憲即飭讞<lb n="left-6" />局訊問該革員狀似瘋癲聲稱被參<lb n="left-7" />後家累甚重不能囘里頃間欲稟明<lb n="left-8" />上憲倘或不准願自斃於階<lb n="left-9" />下云々局員據情上稟刻<lb n="left-10" />下聞已批准祗作瘋子辦<lb n="left-11" />理想大憲有好生之德瘋<lb n="left-12" />員亦當有悔罪之忱矣</p><note type="scene-inscription" n="建築堂額，橫排右起">明倫堂</note><note type="form-mark" n="原刊圖號">四十七</note><note type="form-mark" n="原刊期碼">甲六</note><note type="artist-signature" n="圖左緣畫款">賈醒卿</note><note type="artist-seal" n="畫款下兩方印" /><note type="printer-seal" n="圖說末一方印" /><note type="scene-inscription" n="場景左部手牌">錢塘縣正堂</note><note type="scene-inscription" n="場景近左版心手牌">欽命浙江布政司</note><note type="scene-inscription" n="場景中左斜置手牌">肅靜</note><note type="scene-inscription" n="肅靜牌後部另牌部分">□避</note></div></body></text></TEI>